%% Diagram: Authentication and Authorization Flow
%% ID: ECOMDY-D26 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal; identity provider TBD
sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Editorial UI
  participant API as Application API
  participant Auth as Identity / role policy (TBD)
  participant Audit as Audit record
  User->>UI: Sign in and request action
  UI->>API: Request with session / identity proof
  API->>Auth: Authenticate identity and evaluate role / scope
  Auth-->>API: Allow or deny
  alt Allowed
    API->>Audit: Record actor, action, resource and outcome
    API-->>UI: Return permitted data or draft action
  else Denied
    API->>Audit: Record denied action with minimal metadata
    API-->>UI: Return access denied
  end
